  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-purple pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Fantastic-Matter Metabolization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b6/Megatron_drinking_Energon.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250803121613\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Megatron drinking Energon\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b6/Megatron_drinking_Energon.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20250803121613\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b6/Megatron_drinking_Energon.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20250803121613 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b6/Megatron_drinking_Energon.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250803121613 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Megatron drinking Energon\" width=\"270\" height=\"205\" data-image-key=\"Megatron_drinking_Energon.gif\" data-image-name=\"Megatron drinking Energon.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Cybertronians/Transformers (Transformers) need to consume <b>Energon</b> in order to keep functioning properly. A loss of <b>Energon</b> can be lethal.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Eat fantastic-matter.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed on fantastic-matter</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Absorption\">Fantastic-Matter Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Empowerment\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Empowerment\">Fantastic-Matter Empowerment</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fantastic-Matter Consumption/Feeding/Hunger</li>\n<li>Unobtainium Consumption/Feeding/Hunger/Metabolization</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can sustain themselves/their powers by feeding on fantastic-matter, taking them into their body as a source for their powers and/or conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Nourishment\" title=\"Perpetual Nourishment\">Perpetual Nourishment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Esoteric Element Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a fantastic matter which has esoteric properties (divine, magic, spiritual, or sentient).</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Compound Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_compound\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Chemical compound\">chemical compound</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable. Molecules of a fantastic compound will include at least one fantastic or semi-fantastic element.</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Element Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_element\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Chemical element\">chemical element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.\n<ul><li><b>Fantastic-Metal Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metal\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Metal\">metal element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.\n<ul><li><b>Fantastic Alloy Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alloy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Alloy\">metal alloy</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable. A fantastic-metal alloy is a mixture predominantly based on one or more metals, and it will include at least one fantastic or semi-fantastic element.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Non-Metal Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nonmetal\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Nonmetal\">Nonmetal element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Metalloid Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metalloid\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Metalloid\">Metalloid element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li><b>Semi-Fantastic element Metabolization</b> - Consumption of an extremely rare and valuable chemical element which does not have supernatural material properties itself, but which can be used to create compounds or alloys having such properties.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Fantastic-Energy Metabolization</a></b> - Consumption of an energy which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic-Radiation Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radiation\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Radiation\">radiation</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li><b>Phlebotinum Metabolization</b> - Consumption of a type of fantastic matter that exists because it was initially created through <a href=\"/wiki/Author_Authority\" title=\"Author Authority\">Author Authority</a> powers.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Absorption\">Fantastic-Matter Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Empowerment\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Empowerment\">Fantastic-Matter Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The user may only be able to absorb a certain amount of fantastic-matter or risk over-dosage</li>\n<li>The user may need to discharge fantastic-matter after a period of time</li>\n<li>The user may not be able to consume their self-generated fantastic-matter</li>\n<li>The user may only be able to absorb specific fantastic-matter</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Scrin (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mariowiki.com/Donkey_Kong\">Donkey Kong</a> (<i>Donkey Kong Bananza</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://metroid.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Samus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:metroid:Dark Samus\">Dark Samus</a> (<i>Metroid</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sonic.fandom.com/wiki/Chaos\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:sonic:Chaos\">Chaos</a> (<i>Sonic the Hedgehog</i>)</li>\n<li>Creatures (<i>Spore</i>)</li>\n<li>Zerg (<i>StarCraft</i>)</li>\n<li>Veti (<i>Tempest Rising</i>); possible</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Transformer\">Cybertronians/Transformers</a> (<i>Transformers</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"40f243953cbc8ca25a61000cebb7c222\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Oh-_Banana--gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Oh,_Banana!.gif\" title=\"Oh, Banana!.gif (2.94 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><nosc